<section class="page-head wrap"><h1>Work With Me</h1><h2>Remote Business Advisor</h2></section>
<section class="section wrap content-page"><div class="prose">
<p>I work with business owners, executives and management teams who want an experienced, independent perspective on performance, strategic decisions, systems and business improvement.</p>
<h2 id="how-i-can-help">How I Can Help</h2>
<h3 id="business-performance-reviews">Business &amp; Performance Reviews</h3>
<p>An independent review of how the business is performing, what may be holding it back and where management attention could have the greatest impact.</p>
<p>Assignments may include reviewing business performance, operations, management information, controls and other factors affecting results.</p>
<h3 id="business-analysis-strategy">Business Analysis &amp; Strategy</h3>
<p>Structured analysis to help management evaluate opportunities, plans and important business decisions.</p>
<p>This may include examining alternatives, testing assumptions, identifying risks and bringing together the information needed for a better-informed decision.</p>
<h3 id="information-systems-process-improvement">Information Systems &amp; Process Improvement</h3>
<p>Reviewing how information, systems and business processes work together and identifying practical opportunities for improvement.</p>
<p>This can include existing software, ERP and accounting systems, manual processes, reporting flows and appropriate use of AI or other technology.</p>
<h2 id="how-i-work">How I Work</h2>
<p>I work primarily on focused remote assignments from Kenya, supporting businesses in Kenya, the UK and other international markets.</p>
<p>The starting point is usually a specific issue, decision or area of the business that would benefit from an independent review.</p>
<h2 id="have-something-you-would-like-me-to-look-at">Have Something You Would Like Me to Look At?</h2>
<p>Tell me briefly about the business issue, what you would like to achieve and the type of support you think may be useful.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://forms.gle/HPmku2CCPTfA9mwv9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss an Assignment →</a></p>
</div></section>
